## Tech stack

- **Retrieval / vector store:** _TBD_ (e.g. FAISS / Chroma) + BM25
- **Reranker:** cross-encoder (_TBD_)
- **Agent framework:** LangGraph 
- **Serving:** FastAPI
- **UI:** Streamlit
- **Eval:** custom harness (RAGAS-style metrics)
- **Infra:** Docker, config-driven (`configs/*.yaml`), request tracing

